        "excluded_from_preparation": [],
        "comments": [
          {
            "paragraph_index": 2,
            "comment": "Adjust pH to 3.0."
          },
          {
            "paragraph_index": 3,
            "comment": ""
          },
          {
            "paragraph_index": 5,
            "comment": ""
          },
          {
            "paragraph_index": 7,
            "comment": ""
          },
          {
            "paragraph_index": 8,
            "comment": "Use Medium No. [92] with 44.2 g/L (final) FeSO4・7H2O, 5 ml 10 N H2SO4 and 0.5 g/L yeast extract. Dissolve ingredients except FeSO4・7H2O, yeast extract and 10 N H2SO4 in 700 ml distilled water and autoclave. Separately dissolve FeSO4・7H2O in 300 ml distilled water with 10 N H2SO4 and autoclave at 110C for 30 min. After cooling, mix the both solutions. Before inoculation, add yeast extract from a sterile stock solution (10%). Checkthe final pH to be 1.5 -- 2.0."
          }
        ],
