          }
        ],
        "comments": [
          {
            "paragraph_index": 2,
            "comment": ""
          },
          {
            "paragraph_index": 4,
            "comment": "Dissolve components, except NaHCO3, dithiothreitol and mannitol,in 900 ml distilled water and autoclave under a N2--CO2 (4:1, v/v) atmosphere. Separately autoclave 3% (w/v) dithiothreitol solution and 1 M mannitol solution under a N2 atmosphere. Add filter--sterilized 5% NaHCO3 [storedunder a N2--CO2 (4:1, v/v) atmosphere] to the medium. Prior to inoculation,add the sterile dithiothreitol and mannitol solutions."
          },
          {
            "paragraph_index": 5,
            "comment": "Use Trace element solution of Medium No. [243] without Na2SeO3・5H2O."
          },
          {
            "paragraph_index": 6,
            "comment": ""
          },
          {
            "paragraph_index": 7,
            "comment": "Use Medium No. [480] with 3.6 g/L D--glucose instead of mannitol. Autoclave 1 M glucose solution separately under a N2 atmosphere, and add to the medium."
          },
          {
            "paragraph_index": 8,
            "comment": ""
          },
          {
            "paragraph_index": 10,
            "comment": ""
          },
          {
            "paragraph_index": 12,
            "comment": ""
          },
          {
            "paragraph_index": 14,
            "comment": ""
          },
          {
            "paragraph_index": 16,
            "comment": "Dissolve nitrilotriacetic acid first in 200 ml of distilled water,and adjust pH to 6.5 with KOH. Then add the remaining salts and adjust volume to 1.0 L. Readjust pH to 7.0 with KOH."
          }
        ],
        "source_capture": {
