            "comment": "Mix ingredients and adjust pH to 7.2. Distribute 0.92 volume of the medium into tubes (e.g., 4.6 ml of the medium in the Hungate tubes) under a N2--CO2 (4:1, v/v) gas mixture, seal with butyl rubber stoppers and autoclave."
