            "paragraph_index": 2,
            "comment": ""
          },
          {
            "paragraph_index": 4,
            "comment": "Mix components thoroughly, adjust pH to 7.2 with KOH, distribute the medium into culture vessels (e.g., 9.4 ml in Balch tubes) under a N2--CO2 (4:1, v/v) gas mixture, seal with butyl rubber stoppers and autoclave. After cooling, aseptically and anaerobically add the following solutions (per 9.4 ml medium, autoclaved or *filter--sterilized):"
          },
          {
            "paragraph_index": 5,
            "comment": ""
          }
        ],
